THE RADIO continues to hiss its static.

<< LightOff RadioLight>>
-> (Use the pole to knock down your radio.)
	NARRATOR: Miraculously, you catch it in your hands.
	NARRATOR: And finally...
	NARRATOR: [i]Silence.[/i]
	NARRATOR: Sweet, beloved silence.
	NARRATOR: You can keep going with a healthy conscience now.
-> (Leave it there for now.)
	<<LightOn RadioLight>>


